    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "We do this one site at a time. A site goes live, it soaks, and only when that soak is clean do we start the next one. No parallel cutovers, not even for the two small ones." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1HalyardWeekly20260908_8> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "Running two systems at one desk for a few weeks is a known, contained pain with a named owner. Two cutovers landing in the same week is an unbounded one, and we've got nobody to hand it to." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1HalyardWeekly20260908_13> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "during cutover, every reporting read comes off the replica" ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1HalyardWeekly20260908_26> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "write it into the runbook as a rule and not as guidance, because guidance gets negotiated at three a.m." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1HalyardWeekly20260908_31> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "The vendor stays the system of record for reference data until the last site is live." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1HalyardWeekly20260908_36> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "one site at a time, two-week soak between sites, reporting off the replica during cutover, vendor holds reference data until Clyde is green" ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1HalyardWeekly20260908_42> ] ;
    narr:variation [ narr:text "The sequential doctrine trades parallel-cutover speed for contained pain — the concurrency alternative was argued and set aside, not disproven." ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1HalyardWeekly20260908_13> ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1HalyardWeekly20260908_8> ] ;
    narr:variation [ narr:text "The newer positions on gatekeeper separation and data-quality gates push against the session's trust in named owners and clean soaks — both ask who holds stopping power when schedule pressure bites." ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Position_CutoverGatekeeperRoleSeparation> ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Position_PreCutoverDataQualityGateEnforcement> ] ;
    narr:variation [ narr:text "Cross-site learning is an unvoiced counter-thread: the one-at-a-time doctrine's main benefit may be skill compounding, which the session never named." ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Position_CrossSiteOperationalLearning> ] ;
    narr:variation [ narr:text "Proactive risk disclosure to oversight sits in tension with the session's framing of a decided, presentable position for the steering group." ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Position_ProactiveGovernanceRiskDisclosure> ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1HalyardWeekly20260908_42> ] ;
    narr:writer "z-ai/glm-5.3-flash:nitro" .
